{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "rsg0n8p8t00455gh", "title": "19.ModelScope模型训练平台配置与使用", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u00bffb19\" id=\"u00bffb19\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua9ce7923\" id=\"ua9ce7923\">分享内容</span></strong></p><ol list=\"u3c683bf8\"><li fid=\"u4a468f61\" data-lake-id=\"uf49fbd6c\" id=\"uf49fbd6c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6c3545df\" id=\"u6c3545df\">ModelScope介绍</span></li><li fid=\"u4a468f61\" data-lake-id=\"uc77e6090\" id=\"uc77e6090\"><span data-lake-id=\"udc1511d9\" id=\"udc1511d9\">环境安装与模型下载</span></li><li fid=\"u4a468f61\" data-lake-id=\"ud701babe\" id=\"ud701babe\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3b4c2490\" id=\"u3b4c2490\">模型推理</span></li><li fid=\"u4a468f61\" data-lake-id=\"u3e51441d\" id=\"u3e51441d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf51bf4d1\" id=\"uf51bf4d1\">模型微调</span></li><li fid=\"u4a468f61\" data-lake-id=\"ub2ed2daa\" id=\"ub2ed2daa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u462f85f5\" id=\"u462f85f5\">模型部署</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"uc1b9a7f8\" id=\"uc1b9a7f8\"><br></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"快速开始\" id=\"快速开始\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0a10ce54\" id=\"u0a10ce54\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">快速开始</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u5979b0d0\" id=\"u5979b0d0\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc5cda68f\" id=\"uc5cda68f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">先熟悉魔搭社区的模型下载和模型推理。设置开发环境，并顺利从魔搭社区开始模型学习，使用和开发。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"环境安装\" id=\"环境安装\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3ed102ff\" id=\"u3ed102ff\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">环境安装</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u1aeb9cb8\" id=\"u1aeb9cb8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u794cecae\" id=\"u794cecae\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">可以使用魔搭社区已经预安装好的 </span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/my/mynotebook/preset\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u4402449d\" id=\"u4402449d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u634053c2\" id=\"u634053c2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">Notebook环境</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u2e45b77c\" id=\"u2e45b77c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\"> 来使用魔搭社区模型。魔搭社区Notebook为新用户提供了100小时的免费GPU算力和不限时长的免费CPU算力，并预安装了大部分模型可运行的环境依赖。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5d92d840\" id=\"u5d92d840\"><span data-lake-id=\"u521100db\" id=\"u521100db\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">如果您希望在本地开发环境使用魔搭社区的模型， 我们推荐使用ModelScope SDK下载模型。您可以使用如下命令安装ModelScope SDK：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pip%20install%20modelscope%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VYPQY%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uc019eff4\" id=\"uc019eff4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u65aafd5f\" id=\"u65aafd5f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">同时我们推荐您安装</span><span data-lake-id=\"u3ac530c9\" id=\"u3ac530c9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\"> </span><a href=\"https://git-scm.com/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u7a61962c\" id=\"u7a61962c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u49d75b2c\" id=\"u49d75b2c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">Git</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u0970d7dd\" id=\"u0970d7dd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ucce10ead\" id=\"ucce10ead\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">和</span><span data-lake-id=\"u32f1db1a\" id=\"u32f1db1a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\"> </span><a href=\"https://git-lfs.com/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u6640f38a\" id=\"u6640f38a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2fa25f8c\" id=\"u2fa25f8c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">Git LFS</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u4994ca39\" id=\"u4994ca39\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u9b45fc28\" id=\"u9b45fc28\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">，这是模型管理包括上传所必须的工具。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"模型下载\" id=\"模型下载\"><span data-lake-id=\"u60f92330\" id=\"u60f92330\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">模型下载</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u891d9a4c\" id=\"u891d9a4c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u07fce34c\" id=\"u07fce34c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">如果您在高带宽的机器上运行，推荐使用ModelScope命令行工具下载模型。该方法支持断点续传和模型高速下载，例如可以通过如下命令，将Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct模型，下载到当前路径下的&quot;model-dir&quot;目录。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22modelscope%20download%20--model%3D%5C%22Qwen%2FQwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct%5C%22%20--local_dir%20.%2Fmodel-dir%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ArHCP%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u6e7b8b91\" id=\"u6e7b8b91\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc11ebebc\" id=\"uc11ebebc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">您也可以使用ModelScope Python SDK下载模型，该方法支持断点续传和模型高速下载：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20modelscope%20import%20snapshot_download%5Cnmodel_dir%20%3D%20snapshot_download(%5C%22Qwen%2FQwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mQ9dj%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u95291ef6\" id=\"u95291ef6\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf87cb679\" id=\"uf87cb679\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">由于模型都是通过Git存储，所以也可以在安装Git LFS后，通过git clone的方式在本地下载模型，例如：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22git%20lfs%20install%5Cngit%20clone%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.modelscope.cn%2FQwen%2FQwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct.git%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hFcVz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u43387ec6\" id=\"u43387ec6\"><span data-lake-id=\"udf9e6d0d\" id=\"udf9e6d0d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">关于模型下载的详细说明，可参考</span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/docs/models/download\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u3482178e\" id=\"u3482178e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1ebab865\" id=\"u1ebab865\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">模型下载文档</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u9500c7d4\" id=\"u9500c7d4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6d62b961\" id=\"u6d62b961\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud5f81c1f\" id=\"ud5f81c1f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">同时，如果模型和ModelScope SDK绑定，则只需要几行代码即可加载模型，同时ModelScope还支持通过AutoModel等接口来加载模型。如下是使用AutoModel和pipeline方式加载模型的示例：</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"使用automodel加载模型：\" id=\"使用automodel加载模型：\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue2ef9f7a\" id=\"ue2ef9f7a\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">使用AutoModel加载模型</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20modelscope%20import%20AutoModelForCausalLM%2C%20AutoTokenizer%5Cn%5Cnmodel_name%20%3D%20%5C%22Qwen%2FQwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct%5C%22%5Cn%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(%5Cn%20%20%20%20model_name%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20torch_dtype%3D%5C%22auto%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20device_map%3D%5C%22auto%5C%22%5Cn)%5Cntokenizer%20%3D%20AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fJDZz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"使用modelscope-pipeline加载模型：\" id=\"使用modelscope-pipeline加载模型：\"><span data-lake-id=\"u95d42c08\" id=\"u95d42c08\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">使用ModelScope pipeline加载模型</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20modelscope.pipelines%20import%20pipeline%5Cnword_segmentation%20%3D%20pipeline('word-segmentation'%2Cmodel%3D'damo%2Fnlp_structbert_word-segmentation_chinese-base')%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DWLig%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"模型推理\" id=\"模型推理\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0fc4adef\" id=\"u0fc4adef\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">模型推理</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u519cebf2\" id=\"u519cebf2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u98285851\" id=\"u98285851\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">推理不同模态多种任务，pipeline是最简单、最快捷的方法。您可以使用开箱即用的pipeline执行跨不同模式的多种任务，下面是一个pipeline完整的运行示例：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20modelscope.pipelines%20import%20pipeline%5Cnfrom%20modelscope.utils.constant%20import%20Tasks%5Cn%5Cninference_pipeline%20%3D%20pipeline(%5Cn%20%20%20%20task%3DTasks.auto_speech_recognition%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20model%3D'iic%2Fspeech_paraformer-large-vad-punc_asr_nat-zh-cn-16k-common-vocab8404-pytorch'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20model_revision%3D%5C%22v2.0.4%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cnrec_result%20%3D%20inference_pipeline('https%3A%2F%2Fisv-data.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com%2Fics%2FMaaS%2FASR%2Ftest_audio%2Fasr_vad_punc_example.wav')%5Cnprint(rec_result)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O4Kse%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u049ff42a\" id=\"u049ff42a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u90dd6955\" id=\"u90dd6955\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">ModelScope兼容了Transformers提供的简单而统一的方法来加载预训练实例和tokenizer。这意味着您可以使用ModelScope加载AutoModel和AutoTokenizer等类。下面是一个大语言模型的完整的运行示例：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20modelscope%20import%20AutoModelForCausalLM%2C%20AutoTokenizer%5Cn%5Cnmodel_name%20%3D%20%5C%22Qwen%2FQwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct%5C%22%5Cn%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(%5Cn%20%20%20%20model_name%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20torch_dtype%3D%5C%22auto%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20device_map%3D%5C%22auto%5C%22%5Cn)%5Cntokenizer%20%3D%20AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)%5Cn%5Cnprompt%20%3D%20%5C%22%E8%AF%B7%E7%AE%80%E8%A6%81%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%8B%E5%A4%A7%E5%9E%8B%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.%5C%22%5Cnmessages%20%3D%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%5C%22role%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22system%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22content%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22You%20are%20Qwen%2C%20created%20by%20Alibaba%20Cloud.%20You%20are%20a%20helpful%20assistant.%5C%22%7D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%5C%22role%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22user%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22content%5C%22%3A%20prompt%7D%5Cn%5D%5Cntext%20%3D%20tokenizer.apply_chat_template(%5Cn%20%20%20%20messages%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20tokenize%3DFalse%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20add_generation_prompt%3DTrue%5Cn)%5Cnmodel_inputs%20%3D%20tokenizer(%5Btext%5D%2C%20return_tensors%3D%5C%22pt%5C%22).to(model.device)%5Cn%5Cngenerated_ids%20%3D%20model.generate(%5Cn%20%20%20%20**model_inputs%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20max_new_tokens%3D512%5Cn)%5Cngenerated_ids%20%3D%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20output_ids%5Blen(input_ids)%3A%5D%20for%20input_ids%2C%20output_ids%20in%20zip(model_inputs.input_ids%2C%20generated_ids)%5Cn%5D%5Cn%5Cnresponse%20%3D%20tokenizer.batch_decode(generated_ids%2C%20skip_special_tokens%3DTrue)%5B0%5D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aGMnE%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"udecbc0ae\" id=\"udecbc0ae\"><span data-lake-id=\"u276d0e93\" id=\"u276d0e93\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">对于暂时未与ModelScope SDK做原生集成的模型，可以先从ModelScope上下载模型，然后通过其他的主流库实现模型推理，以SDXL-Turbo模型为例，完整的模型推理运行示例如下：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20diffusers%20import%20AutoPipelineForText2Image%5Cnimport%20torch%5Cnfrom%20modelscope%20import%20snapshot_download%5Cn%5Cnmodel_dir%20%3D%20snapshot_download(%5C%22AI-ModelScope%2Fsdxl-turbo%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cnpipe%20%3D%20AutoPipelineForText2Image.from_pretrained(model_dir%2C%20torch_dtype%3Dtorch.float16%2C%20variant%3D%5C%22fp16%5C%22)%5Cnpipe.to(%5C%22cuda%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cnprompt%20%3D%20%5C%22cat%5C%22%5Cn%5Cnimage%20%3D%20pipe(prompt%3Dprompt%2C%20num_inference_steps%3D1%2C%20guidance_scale%3D0.0).images%5B0%5D%5Cnimage.save(%5C%22image.png%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ffNGl%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"模型微调\" id=\"模型微调\"><span data-lake-id=\"u55e4bcde\" id=\"u55e4bcde\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">模型微调</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"ub5856261\" id=\"ub5856261\"><span data-lake-id=\"u903f3272\" id=\"u903f3272\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">本文以LLM为例，使用MS-Swift进行模型微调。</span><a href=\"https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u05e9c56c\" id=\"u05e9c56c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u71c7a4f9\" id=\"u71c7a4f9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">MS-Swift</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u4c030715\" id=\"u4c030715\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">是魔搭社区官方提供的大模型工具箱，支持300+大语言模型和80+多模态大模型从微调训练到部署推理的链路。下面是一个LLM自我认知微调的示例：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue38e3edb\" id=\"ue38e3edb\"><span data-lake-id=\"uafce96d0\" id=\"uafce96d0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">安装依赖</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pip%20install%20ms-swift%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22odjOM%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uf6bb6019\" id=\"uf6bb6019\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5dd9d9c6\" id=\"u5dd9d9c6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">微调脚本</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22!CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES%3D0%20%20swift%20sft%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model%20Qwen%2FQwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--train_type%20lora%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset%20'AI-ModelScope%2Falpaca-gpt4-data-zh%23500'%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--torch_dtype%20bfloat16%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--num_train_epochs%201%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_train_batch_size%201%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_eval_batch_size%201%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--learning_rate%201e-4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--lora_rank%208%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--lora_alpha%2032%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--target_modules%20all-linear%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--gradient_accumulation_steps%201%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--eval_steps%201%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--save_steps%201%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--save_total_limit%205%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--logging_steps%201%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_length%202048%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--output_dir%20output%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--system%20'You%20are%20a%20helpful%20assistant.'%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--warmup_ratio%200.05%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataloader_num_workers%204%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_author%20swift%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_name%20swift-robot%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Pgr2u%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uaca95930\" id=\"uaca95930\"><span data-lake-id=\"u875cfd7f\" id=\"u875cfd7f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">微调后推理，注意：ckpt_dir需要修改为训练生成的last checkpoint文件夹</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22!CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES%3D0%20swift%20export%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--ckpt_dir%20output%2Fv0-20250130-165127%2Fcheckpoint-12%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--merge_lora%20true%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PB16k%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u68cdc3f9\" id=\"u68cdc3f9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub645a1b5\" id=\"ub645a1b5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">更多基于MS-Swift进行大模型和多模态模型训练与推理的文档，可以参见文档中心的</span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/docs/large-model-toolchain/swift-intro/quickstart\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u2e500a6b\" id=\"u2e500a6b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3e114b1c\" id=\"u3e114b1c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">大模型训练与推理</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uaa9e87d4\" id=\"uaa9e87d4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">部分。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"模型部署\" id=\"模型部署\"><span data-lake-id=\"u38916a54\" id=\"u38916a54\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">模型部署</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"uf7245d9f\" id=\"uf7245d9f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u80ffe14c\" id=\"u80ffe14c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">您可以使用魔搭社区</span><span data-lake-id=\"ube7ffd67\" id=\"ube7ffd67\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\"> </span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/my/modelService/deploy\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u0e3cac80\" id=\"u0e3cac80\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3fad75d9\" id=\"u3fad75d9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">SwingDeploy</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u021ea3bf\" id=\"u021ea3bf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u31695cb8\" id=\"u31695cb8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">来一键部署指定的模型到云资源上。SwingDeploy除了支持各种任务小模型的部署外，对于部分大语言模型，SwingDeploy支持部署后直接提供OpenAI API兼容的调用接口。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uca6e78c3\" id=\"uca6e78c3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue4bd5a9c\" id=\"ue4bd5a9c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">如果您希望在自有的GPU环境进行模型部署，我们推荐使用vLLM部署大语言模型，首先您需要设置环境变量来指定使用ModelScope上的模型：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22export%20VLLM_USE_MODELSCOPE%3DTrue%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Jhyef%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u7ed8501b\" id=\"u7ed8501b\"><code data-lake-id=\"u632b626a\" id=\"u632b626a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua46abed5\" id=\"ua46abed5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">vllm&gt;=0.6</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u74e42bc4\" id=\"u74e42bc4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-fg-default)\">支持 vLLM 内置的工具调用功能，部署命令：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22!vllm%20serve%20Qwen%2FQwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JEbCo%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"使用教程\" id=\"使用教程\"><br></h1>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 1308, "description": "分享内容ModelScope介绍环境安装与模型下载模型推理模型微调模型部署快速开始先熟悉魔搭社区的模型下载和模型推理。设置开发环境，并顺利从魔搭社区开始模型学习，使用和开发。环境安